---
import "@/styles/components/HomePage/faq-section.css";

---

<section class="anikawa-faq-section" aria-labelledby="anikawa-faq-title">
  <div class="anikawa-faq-container">
    <!-- ============================================================
     HEADER
     ============================================================ -->

    <header class="anikawa-faq-header">
      <span class="section-badge"> ❓ Frequently Asked Questions </span>

      <h2 id="anikawa-faq-title" class="section-title">
        Anime Questions, Answered
      </h2>

      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Everything you need to know about discovering, watching, and getting
        more out of AniKawa.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- ============================================================
     QUESTIONS
     ============================================================ -->

    <div class="anikawa-faq-list">
      <details class="anikawa-faq-item">
        <summary> What can I do on AniKawa? </summary>

        <p>
          You can discover anime through categories, filters, recommendations,
          and curated collections; explore detailed anime pages; watch available
          episodes; save anime to your personal lists; track your viewing
          history; leave comments and feedback; and manage your profile and
          preferences in one place.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="anikawa-faq-item">
        <summary> Can I save anime to watch later? </summary>

        <p>
          Yes. Logged-in users can add anime to their personal lists, keep track
          of favorites, and return to titles they want to watch later. Your
          viewing history also makes it easier to pick up where you left off.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="anikawa-faq-item">
        <summary> How can I discover anime similar to my favorites? </summary>

        <p>
          AniKawa provides similar-anime recommendations, genre information,
          curated collections, categories, and a detailed discovery system with
          filters for finding anime based on different preferences.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="anikawa-faq-item">
        <summary> What information is available on an anime page? </summary>

        <p>
          Anime pages can include the synopsis, ratings, genres, release
          information, episode details, recommendations, viewing information,
          facts, insights, community features, and AniKawa's own editorial notes
          where available.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="anikawa-faq-item">
        <summary> Does AniKawa add new anime and episodes? </summary>

        <p>
          Yes. AniKawa's catalog is regularly updated with new anime, recently
          released episodes, seasonal titles, and other additions as they become
          available.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="anikawa-faq-item">
        <summary> Which anime genres can I explore? </summary>

        <p>
          You can explore a wide range of genres and themes, including Action,
          Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Romance, Sci-Fi, Sports,
          Supernatural, Thriller, Isekai, Music, and many others.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
